### register 1
POST http://{{$dotenv HOST_URL}}:{{$dotenv PORT}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "name": "tmp",
  "email":"qwer@qwer.com",
  "password": "asdfasdf",
  "type":"BUYER"
}

