### findMyInfo
GET http://{{$dotenv HOST_URL}}:{{$dotenv PORT}}/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ACCESS_TOKEN_TEST}}
